<text><body><div type="page" n="292"><pb n="292" facs="#f0304"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">IV. Der Staat.</fw>
<table xml:id="p292-b1" facs="#f0304-b1" rows="4" cols="5"><row role="label"><cell role="label">Im Landestheile</cell><cell role="label">Landesherrlich.</cell><cell role="label">Ritterguts= eigen.</cell><cell role="label">Stadträthlich.</cell><cell role="label">Zu auswär= tigen Kirchen gehörig.</cell></row><row><cell><placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName> . . .</cell><cell>Hofprediger.<lb/>Waisenhaus=<lb/>  prediger.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-grossaga">Großaga</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-grosssaara">Großsaara</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-langenberg">Langenberg</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-schwaara">Schwaara</placeName>*)<lb/><placeName ref="#place-thieschitz">Thieschitz</placeName>*).<lb/><placeName ref="#place-waltersdorf">Waltersdorf</placeName>.</cell><cell><placeName ref="#place-dorna">Dorna</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-duerrenebersdorf">Dürrenebers=<lb/>  dorf</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-frankenthal">Frankenthal</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-hirschfeld">Hirschfeld</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-koestritz">Köstritz</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-roben">Roben</placeName>.<lb/>Zwötzen=<lb/>  Leumnitz.</cell><cell><placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName><lb/>  bezügl. seiner<lb/>  Stadtpfar=<lb/>  rer.</cell><cell>25 Orte<lb/>(9 Filiale, 16<lb/>  Orte ohne<lb/>  Kirche).</cell></row><row><cell><placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName> . .</cell><cell><placeName ref="#place-graefenwarth-kulm">Gräfenwarth=<lb/>  Kulm</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-dittersdorf">Dittersdorf</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-goeschitz">Göschitz</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-kirschkau">Kirschkau</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-leitlitz">Leitlitz</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-loehma">Löhma</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-mielesdorf">Mielesdorf</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-dittersdorf">Dettersdorf</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-oschitz">Oschitz</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-pahren">Pahren</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-roedersdorf">Rödersdorf</placeName>.<lb/>Schilbach=<lb/>  Zollgrün.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-seubtendorf">Seubtendorf</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-unterkoskau">Unterkoskau</placeName>.</cell><cell><placeName ref="#place-hohenleuben">Hohenleuben</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-triebes">Triebes</placeName>.<lb/>  In beiden<lb/>  Orten die<lb/>  Paragiat=<lb/>  herrschaft.</cell><cell><placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-saalburg">Saalburg</placeName>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-tanna">Tanna</placeName>,<lb/><placeName ref="#place-zeulenroda">Zeulenroda</placeName><lb/>  vocirt den<lb/>  Diacon als<lb/>  Pfarrer von<lb/>  <placeName ref="#place-langenwolschendorf">Langenwol=<lb/>  schendorf</placeName>.</cell><cell>6</cell></row><row><cell><placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lobenstein=<lb/>  Ebersdorf</placeName>.</cell><cell>Ebersdorf.<lb/>Diaconus zu<lb/>  Lobenstein.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-altengesees">Altengesees</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-froessen">Frössen</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-gahma">Gahma</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-harra">Harra</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-heinersdorf">Heinersdorf</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-hirschberg">Hirschberg</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-ruppersdorf">Ruppersdorf</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-titschendorf">Titschendorf</placeName>.<lb/><placeName ref="#place-wurzbach">Wurzbach</placeName>.</cell><cell>—</cell><cell><placeName ref="#place-lobenstein">Lobenstein</placeName><lb/>  bezüglich des<lb/>  Stadtpfar=<lb/>  rers und des<lb/>  Archidia=<lb/>  conus.</cell><cell>11</cell></row></table>
<p xml:id="p292-b2"><lb n="31" facs="#f0304-l31"/>Ein Pfarrwittwenfiscus wurde für die Herrschaft <placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName> nach dem 30jährigen <lb n="32" facs="#f0304-l32"/>Kriege gegründet und den 15. März 1668 confirmirt; in der <placeName ref="#place-herrschaft-schleiz">Herrschaft Schleiz</placeName> <lb n="33" facs="#f0304-l33"/>entstand ein solcher 1704 und in <placeName ref="#place-lobenstein">Lobenstein</placeName> 1608 bis 1618, darauf von Neuem 1670, <lb n="34" facs="#f0304-l34"/>wiederum 1717 und seit 1824 auf das ehemalige Fürstenthum <placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lobenstein-<lb n="35" facs="#f0304-l35"/>Ebersdorf</placeName> ausgedehnt. Bei der 1847 gegründeten gemeinschaftlichen Pensions-</p>
<p><note place="foot" n="*)" xml:id="p292-fn1" facs="#f0304-fn1"><lb n="36" facs="#f0304-l36"/>Patron beider Orte war bis vor Kurzem der Pfarrer von <placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName>.</note></p>
</div></body></text>
